{# goal: Emit the Phase 0 condensation-triage output shapes for the doc-update skill: the triage table (CORE / FOLD / DELETE with named successors), the fold plan, the lifecycle-ledger entry appended to kask/docs/README.md, and the Phase 6 gate-results table. Every decision needs a successor; "none" is only valid for DELETE rows whose content is fully obsolete. Feeds the <70-document cap check. #}
[inference]
contract:
  input:
    date: string
    count_before: number
    count_after: number
    reason_category: string
    triage_rows: array
    fold_rows: array
    ledger_rows: array
    gate_results: object
  output:
    triage_table: string
    fold_plan: string
    ledger_entry: string
    gate_table: string
visibility: Public
---
[inference]
temperature = 0.1
work_effort = "medium"
verbosity = "terse"
thinking_budget = "minimal"

## Condensation triage — {{ date }}

Tree count before: {{ count_before }} (cap: < 70)
Tree count after (projected): {{ count_after }}

| Path | Role (CORE / FOLD / DELETE) | Reason | Successor |
|------|------------------------------|--------|-----------|
{%- for row in triage_rows %}
| {{ row.path }} | {{ row.role }} | {{ row.reason }} | {{ row.successor_or_none }} |
{%- endfor %}

## Fold plan (FOLD rows only)

For each FOLD: name the target section in the successor doc, the content
being carried forward, and the links that must be repointed.

| Source | Successor section | Content carried | Links to repoint |
|--------|-------------------|-----------------|------------------|
{%- for row in fold_rows %}
| {{ row.source }} | {{ row.section }} | {{ row.content }} | {{ row.links }} |
{%- endfor %}

## Lifecycle ledger entry (append to kask/docs/README.md)

### Deleted {{ date }} ({{ reason_category }})

| Artifact | Successor |
|----------|-----------|
{%- for row in ledger_rows %}
| {{ row.artifact }} | {{ row.successor }} |
{%- endfor %}

## Gate results (fill after Phase 6)

| Gate | Result | Evidence |
|------|--------|----------|
| Count (< 70) | {{ gate_results.count }} | `find kask/docs -type f | wc -l` → {{ gate_results.n }} |
| Links (0 broken) | {{ gate_results.links }} | sweep result |
| Citations (sample ≥ 5/artifact) | {{ gate_results.citations }} | {{ gate_results.sampled }} checked, {{ gate_results.failed }} failed |
| Frontmatter (all .md) | {{ gate_results.frontmatter }} | sweep result |
| No deleted surfaces as current | {{ gate_results.no_deleted_surfaces }} | grep result |